<title>UK: SuedwestLB sets $250 mln bond due Dec 1999.</title>
<headline>SuedwestLB sets $250 mln bond due Dec 1999.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers and bookrunners ABN AMRO Hoare Govett and Bear Stearns.</p>
<p> BORROWER   SUEDWESTDEUTSCHE LANDESBANK</p>
<p> AMT    $250 MLN	COUPON     6.25	MATURITY    30.DEC.99</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  100.947   PAY DATE   S14.APR.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.375     REOFFER    99.722    SPREAD	+10 BP</p>
<p> NOTES	S-SHORT FIRST COUPON</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  GERMANY   TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.15	SELL CONC  1.225     PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> NOTES	ISSUED OFF EMTN PROGRAMME</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
